    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“The first time anyone drew an antelope on a wall, they were already two thoughts ahead of the antelope.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Pattern-Mind (1/a Soma Break).</strong> You can spend 1 minute observing a situation — a battle line, a marketplace, a council, a storm system, a faction’s public posture — and then ask the GM one of:</p>\n<ul><li>“What is the actual goal here?”</li><li>“What is being deliberately hidden?”</li><li>“Who is about to break first?”</li></ul>\n<p>The GM gives you at least one true answer. They may colour it; they may not lie about it.</p>",
